<b>Precisely.</b>

14:09.960 --> 14:14.260
<b>But what's the problem? 
Aren't games an everyday thing here?</b>

14:14.260 --> 14:16.860
<b>They are. Normal games are.</b>

14:17.430 --> 14:19.960
<b>But unfortunately for you, 
this one was different.</b>

14:19.960 --> 14:20.630
<b>Huh?</b>

14:20.960 --> 14:25.480
<b>Listen, kid. What you just did
 was break an important taboo.</b>

14:25.770 --> 14:27.550
<b>Let's review the situation.</b>

14:27.550 --> 14:31.970
<b>On your way here this morning, 
you got lost and met a girl.</b>

14:31.970 --> 14:35.930
<b>You were so taken by her beauty, 
you pretended it was an accident,</b>

14:35.930 --> 14:40.490
<b>then sexually harassed her, and tricked her
 into playing a game that you somehow won.</b>

14:40.490 --> 14:43.990
<b>You make it sound a lot worse than it was, 
but that's basically correct.</b>

14:43.990 --> 14:46.040
<b>The only real problem was the harassment.</b>

14:46.040 --> 14:50.990
<b>Taking Stars from other academy students is 
actually quite convenient for Eimei Academy.</b>

14:50.990 --> 14:53.000
<b>So there wasn't a problem at all, then.</b>

14:53.000 --> 14:55.490
<b>But your opponent was someone special.</b>

14:56.490 --> 15:00.110
<b>A second-year high school student 
from Ouka Academy in District 3.</b>

15:00.110 --> 15:02.690
<b>She achieved the highest 
entrance exam score ever,</b>

15:02.690 --> 15:06.220
<b>and held the top position as 
the only Seven Star on the island.</b>

15:06.220 --> 15:08.800
<b>Since enrolling, she has lost zero games.</b>

15:09.510 --> 15:15.190
<b>That charming girl you met is
the "Empress," Saionji Sarasa, in the flesh.</b>

15:15.190 --> 15:18.260
<b>Saionji? I think I've heard that name before.</b>

15:18.260 --> 15:19.520
<b>You probably have.</b>

15:19.520 --> 15:22.890
<b>The Saionji family are the 
founders of Academy Island.</b>

15:22.890 --> 15:26.690
<b>The current head director of 
Academy Island is Saionji Masamune.</b>

15:26.690 --> 15:29.030
<b>Sarasa is Saionji Masamune's granddaughter.</b>

15:29.030 --> 15:31.420
<b>She's a VIP among VIPs.</b>

15:31.420 --> 15:34.030
<b>And that's who I beat?</b>

15:34.030 --> 15:37.030
<b>Yes. An unimportant little guy like you.</b>

15:37.030 --> 15:41.460
<b>A guy with the lowest transfer 
exam score ever, barely scraping in.</b>

15:41.460 --> 15:44.030
<b>Someone with such a
 refreshingly low status.</b>

15:44.030 --> 15:46.110
<b>A commoner. An NPC.</b>

15:46.110 --> 15:48.050
<b>Okay, okay. I get the picture.</b>

15:48.340 --> 15:52.710
<b>A guy like you dominated 
Saionji Masamune's granddaughter.</b>

15:52.710 --> 15:56.550
<b>That man is a very proud, 
strict, merciless individual,</b>

15:56.750 --> 15:59.270
<b>and he can be very scary when he's angry.</b>

16:00.050 --> 16:02.530
<b>Does this mean I'm expelled?</b>

16:02.530 --> 16:05.560
<b>If expelling you would settle it,
you'd already be out the door.</b>

16:05.990 --> 16:11.060
<b>That man will do anything to 
protect the Saionji family name.</b>

16:11.280 --> 16:15.030
<b>But there is still one way to save you.</b>

16:16.110 --> 16:19.080
<b>I'll make you a Seven Star.</b>

16:20.080 --> 16:21.580
<b>Seven Star</b>

16:20.410 --> 16:21.180
<b>Huh?</b>

16:21.900 --> 16:25.210
<b>What is the most troubling 
part of this situation?</b>

16:25.210 --> 16:29.580
<b>It's the fact that the Empress, Saionji 
Sarasa, was defeated by a commoner.</b>

16:29.930 --> 16:35.590
<b>If she was defeated by someone on her level, 
Saionji Masamune likely wouldn't be upset.</b>

16:35.590 --> 16:39.470
<b>So we'll make you the same level 
as her. You'll be a Seven Star.</b>

16:39.470 --> 16:41.960
<b>Wait a minute. I'm only a One Star.</b>

16:41.960 --> 16:44.060
<b>I couldn't make it to
Seven Star if it killed me!</b>

16:44.060 --> 16:48.660
<b>Right! You'd never make it,
not even if it killed you.</b>

16:48.660 --> 16:51.320
<b>Because you're such an
 unimportant little twerp!</b>

16:51.320 --> 16:52.980
<b>I said I get the picture already.</b>

16:53.250 --> 16:56.110
<b>But you're very lucky. Check your Device.</b>

16:56.800 --> 16:59.610
<b>You just won a game against the Empress.</b>

16:59.610 --> 17:02.070
<b>Look at the color of the Star
you stole from her.</b>

17:02.070 --> 17:04.380
<b>Wait. Aren't Stars supposed to be white?</b>

17:04.380 --> 17:07.020
<b>Yes, but that's no normal Star.</b>

17:07.020 --> 17:11.420
<b>Only 10 or 15 special Stars like this one
have been confirmed on the island.</b>

17:11.420 --> 17:14.380
<b>The Red Star has a special effect.</b>

17:14.670 --> 17:17.380
<b>When you think of the color red,
 what comes to mind?</b>

17:17.850 --> 17:19.130
<b>Ketchup?</b>

17:19.410 --> 17:22.900
<b>Thank you for the surprisingly 
cute answer. But that's not it.</b>

17:23.350 --> 17:26.460
<b>The Red Unique Star. Its effect is...</b>

17:26.460 --> 17:29.480
<b>it allows you to tell one lie about anything.</b>

17:29.480 --> 17:30.900
<b>That's what it is.</b>

17:32.570 --> 17:36.020
<b>Get it? Aren't lies supposed 
to be red by definition?</b>

17:36.020 --> 17:37.930
<b>A lie? No way.</b>

17:37.930 --> 17:42.080
<b>Yes. Use the lie to buff the data 
that says you're a One Star,</b>

17:42.080 --> 17:43.670
<b>and you can become a Seven Star.</b>

17:43.670 --> 17:46.040
<b>Is that really possible?</b>

17:46.040 --> 17:50.220
<b>Yeah. For a long time, 
before the Empress held it,</b>

17:50.220 --> 17:53.080
<b>that Red Star was in the 
possession of the Saionji family.</b>

17:53.080 --> 17:55.850
<b>Not many people are aware of its effect.</b>

17:55.850 --> 17:57.420
<b>Then, how do you know about it?</b>

17:57.420 --> 18:01.130
<b>Because I myself am a 
previous holder of the Red Star.</b>

18:02.520 --> 18:06.040
<b>So what you're saying is 
I have to become a fake Seven Star?</b>

18:06.040 --> 18:07.810
<b>Yeah. We'll sell it like:</b>

18:07.810 --> 18:11.260
<b>"Transfer student gets record-breaking 
test scores, surpassing even the Empress."</b>

18:11.260 --> 18:13.440
<b>"A new genius appears." 
Something like that.</b>

18:13.440 --> 18:16.700
<b>"He even made it to Seven Star 
on his very first day!"</b>

18:18.260 --> 18:23.190
<b>Of course, you don't <i>have</i> to 
follow this plan. The choice is yours.</b>

18:24.230 --> 18:27.940
<b>If you don't agree to it, then pack up 
your things and leave the island today.</b>

18:28.470 --> 18:32.960
<b>I can make it seem like you used 
an illegal ability to trick the Empress.</b>

18:33.450 --> 18:36.150
<b>But why did you come to the island?</b>

18:36.150 --> 18:39.050
<b>Don't you have some important goal?</b>

18:39.590 --> 18:42.270
<b>Yes, I do have a goal.</b>

18:42.770 --> 18:44.700
<b>There's someone I have to find.</b>

18:45.760 --> 18:47.500
<b>I can't accept a bad ending.</b>

18:47.850 --> 18:52.040
<b>If you give up now, 
you'll probably never see her again.</b>

18:52.040 --> 18:54.250
<b>Does that mean I've been set up?</b>

18:54.250 --> 18:54.860
<b>No.</b>

18:55.060 --> 18:57.780
<b>I hadn't predicted any of this. It's just...</b>

18:58.440 --> 19:00.730
<b>I'm a very cunning woman.</b>

19:01.100 --> 19:05.000
<b>Whether it's lies or accidents, 
I'll take advantage of any opportunity I can.</b>

19:05.000 --> 19:07.180
<b>Fine, I understand.</b>

19:09.530 --> 19:12.340
<b>So I've gotta be that, right? 
The strongest player?</b>

19:13.000 --> 19:14.500
<b>Academy Island</b>

19:13.000 --> 19:14.500
<b>Promises You a Bright Future after Graduation</b>

19:17.600 --> 19:19.720
<b>You're great! You're the best!</b>

19:19.720 --> 19:21.770
<b>I'm not sure I see what's so funny.</b>

19:21.770 --> 19:26.380
<b>"As long as you don't mind getting 
crushed and humiliated. Smug!"</b>

19:26.380 --> 19:27.860
<b>You're making fun of me.</b>

19:27.860 --> 19:30.280
<b>No, no! I'm cheering you on!</b>

19:31.590 --> 19:34.590
<b>But that was the perfect psychological scam.</b>

19:34.590 --> 19:39.280
<b>You can totally separate your 
inner feelings and outward expression.</b>

19:39.280 --> 19:42.530
<b>Scouting you for this academy 
was the right choice.</b>

19:43.010 --> 19:46.280
<b>Um, so where am I supposed 
to live from now on?</b>

19:46.280 --> 19:50.150
<b>Oh. I arranged a dorm for you. 
I'll send the coordinates to your Device.</b>

19:50.150 --> 19:51.050
<b>Thanks.</b>

19:51.050 --> 19:54.490
<b>All right. Looking forward to 
your next great performance!</b>

19:54.490 --> 19:57.060
<b>"As long as you don't mind 
getting crushed and humiliated!"</b>

20:01.290 --> 20:03.210
<b>Special skill, huh?</b>

20:06.470 --> 20:10.670
<b>You know, you gave a wonderful 
speech at the ceremony today.</b>

20:10.670 --> 20:11.790
<b>How did you know?</b>

20:11.790 --> 20:13.440
<b>It was all over Stoc.</b>

20:13.440 --> 20:14.310
<b>O-Oh.</b>

20:14.310 --> 20:16.980
<b>So, what exactly are you after?</b>

20:16.980 --> 20:19.440
<b>You found my weakness
and put yourself in the spotlight,</b>

20:19.710 --> 20:21.870
<b>but you still haven't told anyone my secret.</b>

20:21.870 --> 20:26.200
<b>What's going on? You trying to get even more
 attention before you absolutely crush me?</b>

20:26.700 --> 20:29.960
<b>Spare me. Please stop, I'm begging you.</b>

20:30.960 --> 20:36.740
<b>I know I'm being really selfish,
but I have my own reasons.</b>

20:37.080 --> 20:40.580
<b>My own reasons to keep 
this lie up, no matter what.</b>

20:40.850 --> 20:43.550
<b>So I'm begging you. Don't tell anyone.</b>

20:43.550 --> 20:46.580
<b>I'll do anything you ask. Just don't do that.</b>

20:46.580 --> 20:47.920
<b>Uh, actually...</b>

20:48.300 --> 20:50.510
<b>I have no idea what you're talking about.</b>

20:50.510 --> 20:51.870
<b>Quit playing dumb!</b>

20:51.870 --> 20:54.580
<b>I'm being serious here. Stop joking around.</b>

20:54.580 --> 20:58.440
<b>I'm sure you know by now that I'm...</b>

20:58.440 --> 21:00.640
<b>not actually Saionji Sarasa.</b>

21:01.180 --> 21:01.920
<b>Huh?</b>

21:04.650 --> 21:06.160
<b>Don't "Huh?" me!</b>

21:06.480 --> 21:10.280
<b>Yeah. Yeah, that's right. I'm not Sarasa.</b>

21:10.280 --> 21:14.450
<b>I've been acting as her double at the 
academy for the last year. I'm Akabane Rina.</b>

21:14.810 --> 21:19.100
<b>I've been winning games for a year, 
knowing that if I lose, my secret gets out.</b>

21:19.100 --> 21:21.470
<b>But then today, I lost to you.</b>

21:22.190 --> 21:25.590
<b>You took the Red Star from me.</b>

21:25.590 --> 21:27.420
<b>So you must know the truth now.</b>

21:27.420 --> 21:30.350
<b>So the Red Star carries 
that penalty, too, huh?</b>

21:30.960 --> 21:33.290
<b>A-Are you still playing dumb?</b>

21:33.290 --> 21:36.460
<b>In exchange for being able to tell one lie,</b>

21:36.460 --> 21:40.940
<b>the next person to get it finds out 
what that lie was. You must know that.</b>

21:40.940 --> 21:43.930
<b>After all, you're the holder
 of the Red Star now.</b>

21:44.750 --> 21:49.950
<b>Listen, Akabane... I mean, Saionji.
You've got it all wrong.</b>

21:50.160 --> 21:51.100
<b>Huh?</b>

21:51.100 --> 21:54.460
<b>Until you told me just now, 
I didn't know anything about your lie.</b>

21:54.810 --> 22:00.140
<b>I really just came to the island yesterday, 
and I still can't even use the Device right.</b>

22:00.140 --> 22:03.120
<b>This is the first I've heard of the 
Red Star having any disadvantage.</b>

22:03.440 --> 22:05.620
<b>But that <i>can't</i> be true!</b>

22:05.620 --> 22:08.460
<b>You beat me and became a Seven Star, right?</b>

22:08.460 --> 22:11.100
<b>Yeah, I guess that's how it looks.</b>

22:11.100 --> 22:13.600
<b>But I'm not actually a real Seven Star.</b>

22:14.170 --> 22:15.100
<b>Huh?</b>

22:15.100 --> 22:17.610
<b>That's the lie I'm telling.</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>Ouka Academy</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>High School</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>2nd Year</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>Saionji Sarasa</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>Eimei Academy</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>High School</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>2nd Year</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:24.360
<b>Shinohara Hiroto</b>

22:17.610 --> 22:20.560
<b>I'm using the Red Star's effect, you see.</b>

22:20.560 --> 22:23.710
<b>So my real rank is One Star.</b>

22:23.710 --> 22:27.610
<b>I only have the Red Star I took 
from you. I'm the lowest rank.</b>

22:27.610 --> 22:31.620
<b>Just like you, I have my reasons, 
so I have to lie about my Stars.</b>

22:31.620 --> 22:33.600
<b>Um... What?</b>

22:34.530 --> 22:37.740
<b>H-Hold up. Just hold up a second.</b>

22:38.190 --> 22:42.090
<b>So wait, you're <i>not</i> the 
strongest on Academy Island,</b>

22:42.090 --> 22:46.170
<b>you really <i>did</i> win our game by accident, 
and you <i>didn't</i> know about my secret?</b>

22:46.170 --> 22:48.250
<b>Yeah, that's right. That's about it.</b>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.760
<b>No way. So that means I...
did this to myself?</b>

22:54.410 --> 22:59.150
<b><i>Hold on. She's a double, 
not the real Empress.</i></b>

22:59.400 --> 23:02.370
<b><i>So she </i>isn't<i> the daughter 
of the Saionji family.</i></b>

23:02.660 --> 23:06.670
<b><i>So even though I beat her, 
the director won't be angry at me?</i></b>

23:06.670 --> 23:10.860
<b><i>So there was no reason for me to 
become a Seven Star in the first place?!</i></b>

23:16.330 --> 23:18.280
<b>This is the dorm?</b>

23:19.210 --> 23:20.670
<b>One thing after another...</b>

23:21.580 --> 23:22.700
<b>Are you kidding me?!</b>

23:25.060 --> 23:27.310
<b>Um, excuse me...</b>

23:28.620 --> 23:31.300
<b>Welcome home, Master.</b>

23:33.920 --> 23:35.170
<b><i>Wow.</i></b>

23:36.590 --> 23:38.190
<b><i>She's super cute.</i></b>
